'''Absorption Charge''' is an alternative [[charge]] to {{stl|Power Charge}}. It is only granted from the {{il|Graven's Secret}}'s mod {{c|mod|Gain Absorption Charges instead of Power Charges}}. Players can generate them the same way they generate power charges.

==Mechanics==

Absorption Charges make your character [[recoup]] a percentage of elemental damage taken as energy shield. This percentage stacks by accumulating more charges.

Note that modifiers that increase the duration of power charges do not apply to absorption charges.

